# Phase 6 frontend build artifacts
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/.vite/
# NB: frontend/dist/ is deliberately COMMITTED, not ignored. It lets the Python
# backend serve the UI with no Node/npm on the demo machine (see app.py
# _mount_frontend). Rebuild it with `cd frontend && npm run build` after any
# frontend change, and commit the result.

# Transient git worktrees created for background subagents. Each is a full
# checkout of this repository; committing one would nest a copy of the repo
# inside itself. They are removed automatically when the agent finishes.
# NB: only `worktrees/` is ignored, not `.claude/` — project settings, skills
# and hooks under `.claude/` are legitimately committable.
.claude/worktrees/
